# Commands

## Setup

```bash
cd Crypto-trader
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate   # Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with API keys
```

## Run Modes

```bash
python main.py paper       # Paper trading (testnet)
python main.py run         # Live trading engine
python main.py dashboard   # Web dashboard only
python main.py trade       # Dashboard + engine (start via UI)
python main.py status      # Portfolio snapshot
python main.py resume      # Manual circuit breaker resume
python main.py reconcile   # Crash recovery position sync
```

## Tests

```bash
python -m pytest tests/ -v
python -m pytest tests/test_strategies.py -v
python -m pytest tests/test_circuit_breakers.py -v
```

## Backtest & Optimize

```bash
python scripts/backtest.py --symbol BTCUSDT --start 2026-01-01 --end 2026-06-30
python scripts/optimize.py --symbol BTCUSDT --is-window 90 --oos-window 30
```

## Dashboard

```bash
python main.py dashboard
# Or: scripts/start_dashboard.sh (run from Terminal.app, not Cursor sandbox)
# Default: http://127.0.0.1:8080
```

## Demo Scripts

```bash
python scripts/test_demo_connection.py
python scripts/test_demo_trade.py
python scripts/test_full_pipeline.py
```

## Config

- `config/settings.yaml` — exchange, engine, universe
- `config/risk.yaml` — sizing, limits, circuit breakers
- `config/strategies.yaml` — strategy params
